{#
Template: docs-category-page.njk
Purpose: Render one rabbit-hole markdown page as a table of contents plus one section per
         category section. A section lists its top `topN` entries by stars; everything else in
         that section sits behind one loudly-labelled expandable panel, so no entry is dropped.
Executed by: scripts/catalog/render.ts -> renderRabbitHolePage() during `catalog:render` and `catalog:sync`.
Receives:
- categoryName: string
- categoryDescription: string
- totalCount: number
- topN: number
- sectionCount: number
- hasSections: boolean
- sections: Array<{ name, anchor, totalCount, visibleItems, hasOverflow, overflowCount, overflowItems }>
- item shape: { name, url, summary, hasStars, starsLabel, hasActivity, activityLabel,
  hasDetails, hasWhyItMatters, whyItMatters, hasMentalDamage, mentalDamage, hasTags, tags }
- isEmpty: boolean
#}
{% macro entry(item) %}- **[{{ item.name }}]({{ item.url }})**{% if item.isHot %} 🔥{% endif %}{% if item.hasStars %} `⭐ {{ item.starsLabel }}`{% endif %}{% if item.hasActivity %} `{{ item.activityLabel }}`{% endif %} {{ item.summary }}{% if item.hasDetails %} <details><summary>More about</summary>

{% if item.hasWhyItMatters %}  {{ item.whyItMatters }}

{% endif %}{% if item.hasMentalDamage %}  _{{ item.mentalDamage }}_

{% endif %}{% if item.hasTags %}  {% for tag in item.tags %}`{{ tag }}`{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}  </details>{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}{# Compact variant for the folded remainder: no nested `More about` panel. #}
{% macro entryCompact(item) %}- **[{{ item.name }}]({{ item.url }})**{% if item.isHot %} 🔥{% endif %}{% if item.hasStars %} `⭐ {{ item.starsLabel }}`{% endif %}{% if item.hasActivity %} `{{ item.activityLabel }}`{% endif %} {{ item.summary }}
{% endmacro %}<!-- This file is generated. Do not edit it directly. Submit tools through config/sources.yml. -->
# {{ categoryName }}

{{ categoryDescription }}

{% if isEmpty %}## Nothing Here Yet

_Even the hype forgot to stop here._
{% else %}_{{ totalCount }} entries in {{ sectionCount }} section{% if sectionCount != 1 %}s{% endif %}, ranked by stars. Each section opens with its top {{ topN }}; the rest of that section waits behind the **▸ more** panel at its end._

## Contents

{% for section in sections %}- [{{ section.name }}](#{{ section.anchor }}) — {{ section.totalCount }}
{% endfor %}{% for section in sections %}
## {{ section.name }}

{% for item in section.visibleItems %}{{ entry(item) }}{% endfor %}{% if section.hasOverflow %}
<details><summary><strong>▸ &nbsp;&nbsp;+{{ section.overflowCount }} more in {{ section.name }} &nbsp;—&nbsp; click to expand</strong></summary>

{% for item in section.overflowItems %}{{ entryCompact(item) }}{% endfor %}
</details>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}